+                 ||     lat     ||                   |               core workqueue  <parent>
+    -------------||-------------||-------------------|---------------------||---------------
+                 ||<------------||----------------HW index---------------->||        <child>
+                 \/             \/                                         \/
+               +-------------------------------------------------------------+
+               |                          enable/disable                     |
+               |                 clk     power    irq    iommu               |
+               |                   (lat/lat soc/core0/core1)                 |
+               +-------------------------------------------------------------+
 
